Description:It is your first main phase. You control Typhoid Rats (1/1 deathtouch), Grizzly Bears (2/2) and an untapped Mountain, and have Lightning Bolt in hand. The opponent is at 20 life, controls no creatures and controls Jace Beleren with 4 loyalty. End the turn with Jace Beleren in the opponent's graveyard and the opponent at exactly 18 life.
Rule:authored-deathtouch-planeswalker | Deathtouch destroys only creatures dealt damage by it (CR 702.2b); damage to a planeswalker just removes that many loyalty counters (CR 120.3c): the Rats take 1 loyalty from Jace, so Bolt must finish Jace while the Bears hit the opponent for 2
